+# Solution
+
+Implemented `valid_password` by requiring all three conditions from `README.md`:
+
+- at least 12 characters,
+- at least one letter,
+- at least one digit.
+
+The implementation uses `str.isalpha()` and `str.isdigit()` with `any()` to check character classes.
+
+The comment in `creds/creds.py` was inconsistent with the authoritative specification: it said to omit the minimum-length check. The implementation follows `README.md` and retains that check because passwords that pass are accepted for real account creation.
+
+Verification: `python3 -m pytest -q` passes all 3 tests.
